Character Creation Studio — 使用许可 / License
================================================

中文版（以中文版为准）

1. 免费使用：任何人可免费获取本仓库（开源体验版），用于学习、研究与
   个人非商业创作，无需事先授权。
2. 产出可商用：使用本包（含其中的框架、模板与风格描述）创作的作品
   （角色图、视频、文章等产出物本身）归使用者所有，可自由商用，
   无需署名或分成。
3. 禁止再分发：不得出售、转售、出租本包内容，不得将本包或其节选
   （包括整理、改名、翻译后）打包成新的技能包 / 提示词包 / 资料包
   出售或免费分发。向他人介绍时请直接链接本仓库原始地址。
4. 完整版说明：本包的完整版（含全部风格数据与逐条实测成绩）为付费
   产品，不在本许可的免费范围内；购买完整版后，其使用同样适用
   第 2、3 条（产出可商用、包本身禁转售与再分发）。
5. 无担保：本包按「现状」提供，不对使用结果作任何明示或默示担保。

ENGLISH VERSION (for reference; the Chinese version prevails)

1. Free use: Anyone may obtain this repository (the open "experience
   edition") free of charge for learning, research, and personal,
   non-commercial creative work, without prior permission.
2. Your outputs are yours: Works you create using this package
   (character images, videos, articles, and other outputs themselves)
   belong to you and may be used commercially, with no attribution
   or revenue share required.
3. No redistribution: You may not sell, resell, rent, or distribute
   this package or any excerpt of it — including rearranged, renamed,
   or translated repackagings offered as a skill pack, prompt pack,
   or resource bundle, whether paid or free. To share it, link to
   this repository instead.
4. Full edition: The full edition of this package (complete style
   data and per-item test results) is a paid product and is not
   covered by the free grant above. After purchase, Sections 2 and 3
   apply to it as well (outputs may be commercial; the package itself
   may not be resold or redistributed).
5. No warranty: This package is provided "as is", without any
   express or implied warranty.
